# M2's demo: the plane (right of x 488 at 1440 x 900) pinched by wheels with Ctrl held, which is
# how a trackpad pinch reaches a page and how both builds read one: 25 px for exp(0.25), then
# 50 px for exp(0.5), so 50 x 2.12 px per unit. Whole pixels, because WebKit delivers a wheel's
# delta in whole pixels (Playwright's pinch 1.25, -22.31 px, arrives as -22); Chromium delivers
# half the delta under a device scale of 2, here as on the reference. Then a drag pans it.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 956 488
wheel 0 -25 ctrl
wait 16
wheel 0 -50 ctrl
wait 16
shot pinched
down
move 1056 548 over 160
up
wait 16
shot panned
